# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# KBT EventOS — Attendify™  ·  Environment Template
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. All values are OPTIONAL for the MVP.
# With NO values set, the app runs fully on the device using
# localStorage (perfect for a quick demo or a single kiosk device).
# Set the Supabase pair to share data across devices so the admin
# dashboard sees every participant's phone in real time.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Shared backend (recommended for the live event) ---
# Create a free project at https://supabase.com, run supabase/schema.sql,
# then paste the Project URL and the anon/public key here.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Admin gate ---
# Password for the /admin dashboard. Change this before the event.
# If unset, defaults to "attendify2026" (see src/config/eventConfig.ts).
VITE_ADMIN_PASSWORD=attendify2026

# --- Public base URL (used for QR code generation) ---
# The deployed origin, e.g. https://vdp-frontier-miri.netlify.app
# Leave blank to use the current browser origin at runtime.
VITE_PUBLIC_URL=
